
===== help
$ /tmp/tmp.arEwbyb9d0/omo-profiler --help
omo-profiler is a TUI application for managing configuration profiles stored in ~/.omo/omo.json.

Usage:
  omo-profiler [flags]
  omo-profiler [command]

Available Commands:
  completion   Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  create       Create a new profile
  current      Show the name of the active profile
  export       Export a profile to a file
  help         Help about any command
  import       Import a profile from a JSON file
  list         List all profiles
  models       Manage registered models
  schema-check Check if embedded schema differs from upstream
  switch       Select a profile for activation
  web          Launch the web UI for managing profiles

Flags:
  -h, --help      help for omo-profiler
  -v, --version   version for omo-profiler

Use "omo-profiler [command] --help" for more information about a command.
-> exit=0

